  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br>Welcome to Lone Star Hideaway, your breezy beachside escape perfectly located in Santa Rosa Beach along the laid-back charm of 30A. Designed for comfort, connection, and effortless coastal living, this spacious 7-bedroom, 7-bathroom home is ideal for families and groups looking to enjoy sun-soaked days and relaxed evenings near the Gulf.<br><br>Inside, the home features a light-filled, coastal-inspired interior with an open-concept layout that makes gathering easy. The fully equipped kitchen includes a large refrigerator and ample prep space, keeping everyone’s favorite snacks and drinks close at hand. The living and dining areas flow seamlessly onto a breezy balcony—perfect for morning coffee or unwinding after a day at the beach. Each bedroom offers its own private bathroom, creating a peaceful retreat for every guest.<br><br>Step outside to your private backyard oasis, where a sparkling pool and hot tub take center stage. Outdoor seating and a BBQ grill create the perfect setting for poolside meals and relaxed afternoons. A golf cart is included, making trips to the beach, nearby shops, and local dining spots quick and convenient. Additional amenities include in-home laundry and driveway parking for added ease during your stay.<br><br>Ideally situated near Gulf Place Town Center, Blue Mountain Beach, and miles of scenic bike paths, Lone Star Hideaway puts you close to some of 30A’s most popular attractions while still offering a quiet place to unwind. Whether you’re exploring coastal communities, dining at local favorites, or lounging by the pool, this home is your perfect base for making lasting memories on Florida’s Emerald Coast.<br><br>About Bonheur Vacations<br><br>Bonheur Vacations provides a personalized hospitality experience designed to elevate your stay. Our local team is available to assist with trip planning, recommendations, and guest services to ensure a seamless and enjoyable vacation from arrival to departure.<br><br>About 30A<br><br>30A is a scenic 20-mile stretch of coastal highway along Florida’s Emerald Coast, known for its sugar-white sand beaches, turquoise waters, and charming beach towns. From Seaside to Laguna Beach, each community offers its own unique personality, with boutique shopping, bike-friendly streets, and exceptional local dining. We encourage guests to explore and experience all that 30A has to offer.<br><br>Local Attractions<br><br>The Hub 30A<br>Gulf Place Plaza<br>Grayton Beach State Park<br>Blue Mountain Beach<br>Camp Helen State Park<br>Henderson Beach State Park<br>Village of Baytowne Wharf<br>Alys Beach<br>Seaside Beach<br>Laguna Beach<br>WaterColor Beach<br><br>Pets are not allowed at this home<br><br>Pool heating is available for an additional fee and must be requested in advance<br><br>Parking<br><br>Two uncovered parking spaces available in the driveway",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "LONE STAR HIDEAWAY YOUR ULTIMATE 30A ESCAPE! Pool, spool, hot tub, golf cart"
        }
      ],
